9:  * Wikipedia entries for
10:  * <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-16/UCS-2">UTF-16/UCS-2</a>
11:  * and <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UTF-8">UTF-8</a>.
